<title>FRANCE: HORSE RACING-GRAND PRIX DE DEAUVILLE RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-GRAND PRIX DE DEAUVILLE RESULT.</headline>
<text>
<p>DEAUVILLE, France, Aug 25 (France) - Result of the Grand</p>
<p>Prix de Deauville for three-year-olds and upwards run over</p>
<p>12-1/2 furlongs (2.5 km) on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Strategic Choice (Richard Quinn)</p>
<p>2. Tarator (Olivier Peslier)</p>
<p>3. Percutant (Dominique Boeuf)</p>
<p>4. Helen of Spain (Thierry Jarnet)</p>
<p>Nine ran.</p>
<p>Distances: A neck, a short head, 1 length.</p>
<p>Winner owned by Martyn Arbib and trained by Paul Cole in</p>
<p>England.</p>
<p>Value to the winner: 102,108 dollars.</p>
<p>Pari-Mutuel (to a one franc stake): Win 8.00; places 2.20,</p>
<p>1.30, 2.30. Dual Forecast 11.40.</p>
</text>
